      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait stitches with dental floss?? that sounds kinda intense lol. i wasnt really planning on doing surgery on myself. is there like a faster way to just close the wound so i dont have to worry about it while i work? something like superglue or something? and is the soap enough to make sure i dont get tetanus?",
