      "role": "user",
      "content": "superglue and nail polish? i mean if that works i guess. but i'm still kinda worried about the puncture part... since it was deep and pretty dirty. do you think the peroxide and soap is actually enough to kill everything deep inside, or should i maybe soak it in something stronger like alcohol or something? i really just want to avoid a clinic visit if i can manage it here.",
